<title>GERMANY: Buba will not hold news conference after meeting.</title>
<headline>Buba will not hold news conference after meeting.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said it will not hold a news conference after its council meeting today, Wednesday.</p>
<p>The council's regular fortnightly meetings are usually held on Thursdays but have been brought forward by one day this week because of the May Day holiday.</p>
<p>The central bank is not expected to change key interest rates at the meeting.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
